        "content": "**Source:** `mm_events` (`ControllerDiagnostics.action_pipeline.*.rejection_counts`).\n\nOne chart per funnel stage; each line is a rejection reason count at that stage. Risk uses `action_pipeline.risk_approved` with fallback to top-level `risk.rejection_counts`.",
